## Third-Party Licenses

Enliven includes and depends on the following open-source projects, each with their own licenses:

### LivePortrait
- **License:** MIT License
- **Repository:** https://github.com/KwaiVGI/LivePortrait
- **Copyright:** Kuaishou Visual Generation and Interaction Center
- **Use:** Expression and pose transfer engine (bundled in `vendor/liveportrait/`)

### MediaPipe
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Repository:** https://github.com/google/mediapipe
- **Copyright:** Google
- **Use:** Face detection and landmark extraction

### GFPGAN
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Repository:** https://github.com/TencentARC/GFPGAN
- **Copyright:** Tencent ARC Lab
- **Use:** Optional face enhancement (not required for core functionality)

### OpenCV
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Repository:** https://github.com/opencv/opencv
- **Copyright:** OpenCV Team
- **Use:** Image processing utilities

